---
// ServicesSocialProof.astro - Marc Vitulli testimonial, 4x/60%/60+ metrics, and S&S Activewear story
---

<section class="sv-proof" id="services-social-proof" data-theme="light" aria-label="Client testimonial and impact">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sv-proof__grid" data-sv-reveal>
      <div class="sv-proof__portrait">
        <img
          src="/images/why-us/marc-vitulli.jpg"
          alt="Marc Vitulli, VP Marketing at S&S Activewear"
          class="sv-proof__avatar"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          data-cms-key="services.proof.avatar"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="sv-proof__body">
        <blockquote class="sv-proof__quote" data-cms-key="services.proof.quote">
          “Thanks to Adaptif, we’ve elevated ourselves. We’ve changed marketing in the industry by acting as more of a marketing agency for our brands, and streamlining that into robust marketing campaigns that move the needle.”
        </blockquote>

        <p class="sv-proof__author" data-cms-key="services.proof.author">
          Marc Vitulli, VP Marketing at S&amp;S Activewear
        </p>

        <div class="sv-proof__bottom">
          <dl class="sv-proof__metrics">
            <div class="sv-proof__metric">
              <dt data-cms-key="services.proof.metric1.label">Increase in design capacity</dt>
              <dd data-sv-count="4" data-sv-suffix="x" data-cms-key="services.proof.metric1.value">4x</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="sv-proof__metric">
              <dt data-cms-key="services.proof.metric2.label">Reduction in time to market</dt>
              <dd data-sv-count="60" data-sv-suffix="%" data-cms-key="services.proof.metric2.value">60%</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="sv-proof__metric">
              <dt data-cms-key="services.proof.metric3.label">Number of brands</dt>
              <dd data-sv-count="60" data-sv-suffix="+" data-cms-key="services.proof.metric3.value">60+</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>

          <a href="/our-work" class="sv-proof__story" data-cms-key="services.proof.story">
            <img
              src="/images/ai-excellence/blog-thumb.jpg"
              alt="S&S Activewear creative showcase"
              class="sv-proof__story-thumb"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
            <div class="sv-proof__story-meta">
              <span class="sv-proof__story-eyebrow">S&amp;S Activewear</span>
              <span class="sv-proof__story-title">How To Keep Creative Fresh for 60+ Different Brands</span>
            </div>
            <span class="sv-proof__story-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .sv-proof {
    position: relative;
    padding: clamp(56px, 7vw, 96px) 0;
    background: #ffffff;
    color: #090d16;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
  }

  .sv-proof__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(24px, 4vw, 52px);
    align-items: start;
    max-width: 1060px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .sv-proof__portrait {
    width: clamp(92px, 11vw, 132px);
    height: clamp(92px, 11vw, 132px);
    border-radius: 18px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.1);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 36px -14px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.25);
  }

  .sv-proof__avatar {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 20%;
    display: block;
  }

  .sv-proof__quote {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    font-family: var(--font-family-body);
    font-size: clamp(1.12rem, 1.55vw, 1.38rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.5;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: #090d16;
  }

  .sv-proof__author {
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    font-family: var(--font-family-body);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #475569;
  }

  .sv-proof__bottom {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 24px 36px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.1);
  }

  .sv-proof__metrics {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 28px 42px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .sv-proof__metric {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column-reverse;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .sv-proof__metric dt {
    font-family: var(--font-family-body);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #475569;
  }

  .sv-proof__metric dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-family-display);
    font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 3vw, 2.7rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1;
    color: #0284c7;
  }

  .sv-proof__story {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 10px 14px 10px 10px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.1);
    background: #f8fafc;
    text-decoration: none;
    max-width: 340px;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
  }

  .sv-proof__story:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.35);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 28px -12px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.18);
  }

  .sv-proof__story-thumb {
    width: 64px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    object-fit: cover;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .sv-proof__story-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .sv-proof__story-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-family-body);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #0284c7;
  }

  .sv-proof__story-title {
    font-family: var(--font-family-body);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: #0f172a;
  }

  .sv-proof__story-arrow {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #0284c7;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .sv-proof__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .sv-proof__story {
      max-width: 100%;
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
